5,1,1,talk,Midori,,I worry about sustainability. Where do these programs usually fail after the first year?,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,We need to know what previous initiatives actually achieved before adding more.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
