8,1,1,talk,Shion,,The budget is shrinking. I need to know what we can actually afford to build.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,The hospital is already full. I need to check if we have the physical space.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shion, that is a valid point. We must ensure the foundation is solid.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,Agreed. History is a useful teacher here.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I will look at the staffing reviews.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
