16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will look at the readmission figures and the data agreements.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I will check the ward vacancies and the therapy staffing.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shion,,I will also look at the regional fund tariffs.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will also check the parking and shuttle coverage.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Midori,,Let us see what the records say.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
